    "analysis": {
      "investment_rationale": [
        {
          "institution": "Ventech",
          "speaker": "Nicolas Barthalon",
          "speaker_role": "Ventech合伙人",
          "rationale": "Ventech认为旅游预订正经历结构性转变，YGO的中立基础设施已让客户用AI重新掌握客户关系并取得可验证的KPI提升，因此有望成为AI优先时代旅游运行的关键层。",
          "quote": "Online travel booking is undergoing its biggest structural shift in decades but most of the industry's infrastructure was never built for it.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-c878fb5affb919e7",
              "quote": "Online travel booking is undergoing its biggest structural shift in decades but most of the industry's infrastructure was never built for it.",
              "source_content_hash": "d53efb2536430937",
              "quote_hash": "522a05dde1399e5e2c3ffa70b5ff64c70c8852ad84aa820a0e0fb1af1e2d5edb"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "capital_judgment": "本轮资本押注的核心变量是：在旅游分销从OTA/元搜索转向AI代理入口的过程中，YGO能否以不替换既有系统的中立编排层成为供应商对接AI渠道的基础设施。已验证信号包括：已为Condor、Bentour、GetAway Group处理预订，累计处理预订额超€15 million，六个月内经常性ARR达七位数，并披露客户人工操作下降90%、转化率提升20%、平均订单价值提升2.4倍。证据边界在于：上述KPI仅以匿名客户口径披露，ARR与预订额未给出精确数值，且尚无估值或收入确认细节。",
      "validated_signals": [
        "已为Condor、Bentour、GetAway Group处理预订",
